Game-library / launcher marks in this directory are monochrome
`currentColor` SVGs, rendered by `src/components/OsIcon.astro` with
`dir="launcher-icons"`. Per-file provenance is also kept in each SVG's
header comment. Upstream sources and licenses:

- epic.svg — Epic Games logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0),
  slug `epicgames`.
- gog.svg — GOG logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0), slug `gogdotcom`.
- heroic.svg — Heroic Games Launcher logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0),
  slug `heroicgameslauncher`.
- lutris.svg — Lutris logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0), slug `lutris`.
- playnite.svg — Playnite logo, from `media/playnite-logo-black.svg` in
  JosefNemec/Playnite (MIT).
- steam.svg — Steam logo, from Font Awesome Free 5 brands (CC BY 4.0).
- xbox.svg — Xbox logo, from Font Awesome Free 6 brands (CC BY 4.0),
  `fa-xbox`.

